{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the per-extension scripts/install.ts files.",
    "Edit pins here, then run: bun run scripts/generate-install-scripts.ts",
    "Verify nothing drifted:   bun run scripts/generate-install-scripts.ts --check",
    "Do NOT hand-edit extensions/*/scripts/install.ts - regenerate instead.",
    "",
    "Kept out of aion-extension.json deliberately: the upstream manifest schema",
    "sets additionalProperties:false, and its `dependencies` field means",
    "{ extensionName: versionRange } for AionHub extensions - not npm packages."
  ],
